---
import { siteConfig } from '../../data/site'

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear()
---

<footer class="border-t border-gray-900 bg-black">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-4">
          <img src="/images/logo-ist.png" alt="Logo IST - In Sáng Tạo" class="h-14 w-auto" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-2xl leading-none font-black text-orange-500">IN SÁNG TẠO</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-400">Thiết kế - In ấn - Quảng cáo</p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
          <strong>{siteConfig.legalName}</strong> cung cấp giải pháp thiết kế, in ấn, sản xuất và thi công bảng hiệu quảng cáo cho cửa hàng, doanh nghiệp, cơ quan và tổ chức.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-800 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-gray-400">In ấn</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-800 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-gray-400">Tem nhãn</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-800 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-gray-400">Bảng hiệu</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-lg font-bold text-white">Dịch vụ chính</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-500">
          <li>In tem nhãn</li>
          <li>Thi công bảng hiệu</li>
          <li>Combo mở quán</li>
          <li><a href="#contact" class="transition hover:text-orange-500">In bạt - decal - standee</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact" class="transition hover:text-orange-500">In hóa đơn - biểu mẫu</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact" class="transition hover:text-orange-500">In túi xốp</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-lg font-bold text-white">Liên kết nhanh</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-500">
          <li>Về In Sáng Tạo</li>
          <li>Năng lực IST</li>
          <li>Nhà xưởng &amp; máy móc</li>
          <li>Sản phẩm &amp; dịch vụ</li>
          <li>Công trình tiêu biểu</li>
          <li>Blog tư vấn</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-lg font-bold text-white">Liên hệ In Sáng Tạo</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <a
            href="https://share.google/amP6wZmKCmUaGO1JT"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/60 p-4 transition hover:border-orange-500/60"
          >
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-500" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M12 21s7-4.35 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 6.65 7 11 7 11z" />
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M12 10.5a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="block text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">{siteConfig.contact.address}</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-xs font-semibold text-orange-500">Xem trên Google Maps →</span>
            </span>
          </a>

          <a href={`tel:${siteConfig.contact.phone}`} class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/60 p-4 transition hover:border-orange-500/60">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-500" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M3 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5.5 3h2A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 9 4.3l.6 3A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 8.8 9L7.5 9.7a12.5 12.5 0 0 0 6.8 6.8l.7-1.3a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.7-.8l3 .6A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 21 16.5v2A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 18.5 21h-.5C9.7 21 3 14.3 3 6v-.5z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="mb-1 block text-sm font-semibold text-white">Hotline / Zalo</span>
              <span class="block text-sm font-bold text-orange-500">{siteConfig.contact.phoneDisplay}</span>
            </span>
          </a>

          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`} class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/60 p-4 transition hover:border-orange-500/60">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-500" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M4 6h16v12H4z" />
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="m4 7 8 6 8-6" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="break-all text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">{siteConfig.contact.email}</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 border-t border-zinc-900 pt-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between">
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">© {currentYear} {siteConfig.legalName}. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Thiết kế - In ấn - Bảng hiệu quảng cáo tại Cầu Ngang, Vĩnh Long</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
